{"id":"weniger","lemma":"weniger","pos":"adv","rank":509,"glosses":["less","minus"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/4/4e/De-weniger.ogg/De-weniger.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Vielleicht solltest du weniger trinken.","en":"Maybe you should drink less.","words":[{"g":"perhaps, maybe"},{"g":"should","l":"sollen"},{"g":"you"},null,{"g":"to drink by mouth)"}]},{"text":"Ich habe weniger als du.","en":"I have less than you.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},null,{"g":"at the same moment"},{"g":"you"}]},{"text":"Er ist ein Mann weniger Worte.","en":"He is a man of few words.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"man, male human being"},null,{"g":"word as an isolated unit","l":"Wort"}]},{"text":"Ich verstehe es mehr oder weniger.","en":"I understand it more or less.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to hear and interpret","l":"verstehen"},{"g":"it"},{"g":"more"},{"g":"or"},null]},{"text":"„Hast du verstanden?“ — „Mehr oder weniger.“","en":"\"Did you understand?\" \"More or less.\"","words":[{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to hear and interpret","l":"verstehen"},{"g":"more"},{"g":"or"},null]}]}